          "text": "approximately $4.15$ moles",
          "misconception": null
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "approximately $0.415$ moles",
          "misconception": "misplace_decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "approximately $41.5$ moles",
          "misconception": "misplace_decimal_reverse"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "approximately $2.5$ moles",
          "misconception": "mole_is_grams"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "explanation": "Divide the number of atoms by Avogadro's number: $2.5\\times10^{24} / 6.02\\times10^{23} \\approx 4.15$ moles; the other options misplace the decimal or treat moles as grams."
